                    "learner_level": "C2",
                    "frequency": "Low",
                    "semantic_group_id": "medical",
                    "name_type": "no",
                    "examples": [
                        {
                            "text": "The patient was diagnosed with <w>borderline</w> after years of struggling.",
                            "target_lang_translations": {
                                "ru": "После долгих лет страданий пациенту диагностировали <w>пограничное расстройство</w>."
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Therapy can be very effective for those living with <w>borderline</w>.",
                            "target_lang_translations": {
